<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.4">
<l>neṭumai yālula kēḻuma ḷantāy</l>
<l rend="indent">niṉma lāneṭi yāyaṭi yēṉaik</l>
<l>kuṭimai koḷvataṟ kaiyuṟa vēṇṭā</l>
<l rend="indent">kūṟai cōṟivai vēṇṭuva tillai</l>
<l>yaṭimai yeṉṉumak kōyiṉmai yālē</l>
<l rend="indent">yaṅkaṅ kēyavai pōtaruṅ kaṇṭāy</l>
<l>koṭumaik kañcaṉaik koṉṟuniṉ tātai</l>
<l rend="indent">kōtta vaṉtaḷai kōḷviṭut tāṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>You who measured the seven worlds with your height,</l>
<l rend="indent">Faultless One, Tall One!</l>
<l>Don’t hesitate to take me, your servant, into servitude.</l>
<l rend="indent">Clothes and rice, I have no need for these.</l>
<l>With the dignity of that servitude,</l>
<l rend="indent">then and there those will come [to me], you see.</l>
<l>You who, by taking the head of the one who bound your father,</l>
<l rend="indent"> killing cruel Kaṃsa, liberated [him].</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
